  <p class="cp-label">The collaboration</p>
  <p class="cp-quote">"Open, gripping, and free from all constraints — while offering optimal comfort and performance."</p>

  <p class="cp-body">Coperni × Barreletics is a collaborative footwear line developed for the Coperni Spring–Summer 2026 Ready-to-Wear Collection, blending high fashion with functional performance. The partnership introduced a Pilates shoe designed for comfort, grounding, and athletic poise — emphasizing stability and grip during movement.</p>
  <p class="cp-body">These shoes were created to support the collection's overarching theme of merging biotechnology, wellness, and human-centered design — aligning with Coperni's focus on innovation and the body's natural rhythms.</p>
